# Commits that changed formatting and nothing else. Listed here so `git blame`
# attributes lines to whoever wrote them rather than to the reformat.
#
# Empty for now, and on purpose. amiral was formatted from its first Swift commit
# (.swift-format arrived with the code), so no commit has been formatting only. The
# next one goes here, typically a new Swift toolchain added to SWIFT_FORMAT_VERSIONS
# that rewraps code nobody touched. Keep it its own commit and merge it --ff-only: a squash or rebase rewrites
# the SHA listed here.
#
# A local clone ignores this file until `make blame-setup` runs:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
